++// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
++/*
++ * SD3589C NAND + UBI OTA recovery commands
++ *
++ * Commands:
++ *   misc_check                - read uflag, return 1 if PENDING/RUNNING
++ *   nand_ota_upgrade          - read upgrade pkg from UBI upgrade volume, verify and flash
